rinol Metab Clin North Am</source><volume>19</volume><fpage>637</fpage><lpage>48</lpage><comment>1990 Mar 1</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2261909</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Makay</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Kaya</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Ertan</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Icoz</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Akyildiz</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Yilmaz</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Tuncyurek</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Yetkin</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Primary Squamous Cell Carcinoma of the Thyroid: Report of Three Cases</article-title><source>Endocr J</source><year>2008</year><comment></comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18379125</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Minagawa</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Iitaka</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Suzuki</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Yasuda</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kameyama</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Shimada</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kitahama</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Wada</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Katayama</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A case of primary mucoepidermoid carcinoma of the thyroid: molecular evidence of its origin</article-title><source>Clin Endocrinol (Oxf)</source><year>2002</year><volume>57</volume><fpage>551</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12354139</